From ca1bc6ddc2d8855f9dfc3cc94e245ab5f3f37c5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 23:05:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hypervisor: Reserve KVM vCPU descriptors before restore

Add bounded explicit vCPU preparation for x86_64 and aarch64 KVM.
Reuse descriptors in the existing create_vcpu path; leave architectural
initialization there. VM ownership handles partial-allocation cleanup.
Other backends report unsupported preparation and keep normal creation.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
Signed-off-by: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
